{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間の乃木坂工事中にて選抜発表がありました！\n今回15thシングル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーメンバーとして参加させていただきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのコメントや握手会、755などでの\nあたたかいコメント、本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも支えられてばっかで、なかなかみなさんの期待に応えることができず申し訳ない気持ちは正直あります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも恩返ししたいな‥っていつも思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目の前のことを全力に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでもいいパフォーマンスや笑顔を届けれたら、少しでもみなさんがHAPPYな気持ちになっていただけるようこれからも全力で頑張っていきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだなんもできない私ですが応援宜しくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして大好きな大好きなあすかがセンターって発表された時本気で本気で嬉しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐに抱きつきに行きたかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録後走って抱きしめに行った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにほんとにおめでとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかの周りにはたくさんのおねいさんメンバーがいるからたくさん頼って頑張ってー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやもあすかにできることならなんでもする"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前みたいによる電話かけて楽しませる〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぃちゃんもひめたんもずっとずっと近くで頑張りを見てきてたから本当に嬉しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぃちゃんらしくひめたんらしくがんばってねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！６月19日9時から10時のラジラーに出演させていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして６月12日バズ☆ドルの放送もお見逃しなく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レギュラー番組！のぎえいごものぎゴルフもチェックしてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっゴルフといえば雑誌GREEN GORA vol.3\nが６月16日発売(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)見てねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバムの特典！サイン会でのヘアスタイル"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音符ちゃんヘアー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに会った人やいつも来てくださる方など！平日なのにわざわざ来てくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"距離もみんなと近くってちょっとお話もできてとってもたのしかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/08/4028915/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text"